msgid ""
"Actions that declare a speed tier (Translate, Quick Define and Quick Explain by default; configurable per action in the action editor) use a faster model from your current provider for that request. Only the model changes; the prompt and settings stay the same. Providers without tier data keep the current model. Turn off to always use your configured model."
